{"id":"15-2562-2-5","zh":"主格：sabbaṃ，sabbāni。","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-2562-6-9","zh":"宾格：sabbaṃ，sabbāni。","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-2562-10-15","zh":"具格：sabbena，sabbehi，sabbebhi。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-2562-16-21","zh":"与格：sabbassa，sabbesaṃ，sabbesānaṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-2562-22-30","zh":"从格：sabbasmā，sabbamhā，sabbehi，sabbebhi。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-2562-31-36","zh":"属格：sabbassa，sabbesaṃ，sabbesānaṃ。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-2562-37-42","zh":"处格：sabbasmiṃ，sabbamhi，sabbesu。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-2562-43-48","zh":"呼格：bho sabba，bhavanto sabbāni。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-2562-49-51","zh":"以上是中性的名词词形变化表。","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-2563-2-10","zh":"这里，“sabbaṃ bhūtaṃ（一切生物），sabbāni bhūtāni（一切生物）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-2563-11-26","zh":"sabbaṃ cittaṃ（一切心），sabbāni cittāni（一切心）”等等，应当把中性的代名词与所有中性名词搭配起来。","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-2563-27-33","zh":"这样，sabba 一词就有按三种性别排列的词形变化表。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-2564-2-14","zh":"现在要了解它与后面的词构成的复合词：“sabbasādhāraṇo（为一切人所共有的）、sabbaverī（与一切人为敌的）”。","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-2564-15-19","zh":"其中，sabbesaṃ sādhāraṇo（为一切人所共有）就是 sabbasādhāraṇo。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-2564-20-31","zh":"sabbesaṃ verī（一切人的敌人），或者 sabbe vā verino yassa（一切人都是他的敌人），这样的人就是 **sabbaverī**——这是复合词的分解。","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-2564-32-46","zh":"正如 sabba 一词的词形变化表是按三种性别来搭配的，katara 等词一直到 adhara 为止，也应当同样搭配。","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-2565-2-6","zh":"下面是其中除去 ubhaya 一词的阳性省略表：","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-2566-2-5","zh":"kataro，katare。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-6-15","zh":"kataraṃ……（中略）……bho katara，bhavanto katare。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-16-19","zh":"katamo，katame。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-20-23","zh":"itaro，itare。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-24-27","zh":"añño，aññe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-28-31","zh":"aññataro，aññatare。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-32-35","zh":"aññatamo，aññatame。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-36-39","zh":"pubbo，pubbe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-40-43","zh":"paro，pare。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-44-47","zh":"aparo，apare。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-48-51","zh":"dakkhiṇo，dakkhiṇe。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-52-55","zh":"uttaro，uttare。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2566-56-67","zh":"adharo，adhare……（中略）……bho adhara，bhavanto adhare。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2567-2-7","zh":"下面是包括 ubhaya 一词在内的中性省略表：","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-2568-2-5","zh":"kataraṃ，katarāni。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-6-15","zh":"kataraṃ……（中略）……bho katara，bhavanto katarāni。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-16-17","zh":"katamaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-18-19","zh":"ubhayaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-20-21","zh":"itaraṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-22-23","zh":"aññaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-24-25","zh":"aññataraṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-26-27","zh":"aññatamaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-28-29","zh":"pubbaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-30-31","zh":"paraṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-32-33","zh":"aparaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-34-35","zh":"dakkhiṇaṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-36-37","zh":"uttaraṃ。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-38-41","zh":"adharaṃ，adharāni。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2568-42-51","zh":"adharaṃ……（中略）……bho adhara，bhavanto adharāni。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2569-2-9","zh":"现在说明阳性与中性的 para 等词的另一种词形。","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-2569-10-27","zh":"在《迦旃延文法》中，可以看到像“purisā”那样的“parā”这一主格复数形式。","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-2569-28-41","zh":"这种用法在 apara、sabba、katara 等直到 aññatama 为止的九个词中并不通行；如果要采用，可以用在 pubba、dakkhiṇa、uttara、adhara 这四个词上。","confidence":70}
{"id":"15-2569-42-75","zh":"同样，可以看到像“purise”那样的处格单数形式：在圣典等处有“pubbe”，在《谛要略》中有“itare”，在《迦旃延文法》中有“pare”。","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-2569-76-91","zh":"这种用法在 sabba、añña 两个词中并不通行；如果要采用，可以用在其余从 katara、katama 等直到 adhara 为止的十二个词上。","confidence":70}
{"id":"15-2569-92-106","zh":"同样，像“purisā”那样的 sabbā、katarā 等从格单数用法，在圣典等处并不通行。","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-2569-107-117","zh":"尽管如此，如果反复审察后认为这种用法合理，也可以采用。","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-2570-2-7","zh":"下面是包括 ubhaya 一词在内的阴性省略表：","confidence":85}
{"id":"15-2571-2-7","zh":"katarā，katarā，katarāyo。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-8-19","zh":"kataraṃ……（中略）……bhoti katare，bhotiyo katarā，katarāyo。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-20-21","zh":"katamā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-22-23","zh":"ubhayā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-24-25","zh":"itarā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-26-27","zh":"aññatarā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-28-29","zh":"aññatamā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-30-31","zh":"pubbā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-32-33","zh":"parā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-34-35","zh":"aparā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-36-37","zh":"dakkhiṇā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-38-39","zh":"uttarā。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-40-45","zh":"adharā，adharā，adharāyo。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2571-46-57","zh":"adharaṃ……（中略）……bhoti adhare，bhotiyo adharā，adharāyo。","confidence":90}
{"id":"15-2572-2-33","zh":"不过，由于在圣典等处可以看到“itarissā”等形式，这些词当中的 itara、añña、aññatara、aññatama 应当说有一些区别，所以在与格、属格单数的位置上，“itarissā，itarāya，aññissā，aññāya。","confidence":70}
{"id":"15-2572-34-45","zh":"aññatarissā，aññatarāya，aññatamissā，aññatamāya”应当这样搭配。","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-2572-46-53","zh":"同样，在具格、从格单数的位置上，由于可以看到“tassā kumārikāya saddhiṃ（与那位少女一起）。","confidence":65}
{"id":"15-2572-54-112","zh":"kassāhaṃ kena hāyāmi（我比谁差、在哪方面差）”这样的具格与从格用例；而在处格单数的位置上，由于可以看到“aññataro bhikkhu aññatarissā itthiyā paṭibaddhacitto hoti（某位比丘对某位女子心生系恋）”这样的圣典用例，应当搭配成“itarissā，itarissaṃ，itarāya，itarāyaṃ，aññissā，aññissaṃ，aññāya，aññāyaṃ，aññatarissā，aññatarissaṃ，aññatarāya，aññatarāyaṃ，aññatamissā，aññatamissaṃ，aññatamāya，aññatamāyaṃ”。","confidence":60}
{"id":"15-2573-2-15","zh":"其中，sabba 一词可以看到用于四种范围：全部一切（sabbasabba）、部分一切（padesasabba）、处一切（āyatanasabba）、有身一切（sakkāyasabba）。","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-2573-16-32","zh":"例如，在“一切法以一切行相进入佛世尊的智慧之门”等处，它用作全部一切。","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-2573-33-44","zh":"在“舍利弗们，从某种意义上说，你们所有人都说得好”等处，用作部分一切。","confidence":70}
{"id":"15-2573-45-80","zh":"在“比丘们，我要为你们讲说一切，你们要好好听，认真作意，我要说了……（中略）……比丘们，什么是一切？眼与色……（中略）……意与法”这里，用作处一切。","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-2573-81-90","zh":"在“他把一切认知为一切”等处，用作有身一切。","confidence":70}
{"id":"15-2573-91-100","zh":"其中，用作全部一切时是没有限定的，用于其他三种时是有限定的，应当这样理解。","confidence":75}
{"id":"15-2573-101-102","zh":"就这样——","confidence":80}
{"id":"15-2574-2-8","zh":"在全部一切、部分一切，以及处一切中；","confidence":70}
